\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Trust-constrained architecture of Auto-Decte. Evidence is transformed into machine-generated candidates or read-only references, while the human trust boundary is the sole transition from candidate data to versioned facts. Recognition, LLM suggestions, and retrieval have no direct write path to the fact plane.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
